---
import { PROBLEM_CARDS } from '../../lib/const';
import Badge from '../ui/badge.astro';
---

<section class='relative bg-black text-white'>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/images/gradient-bg-trimmed.webp')] bg-cover bg-bottom"></div>
  <div class='absolute inset-0 bg-black/63'></div>

  <div class='flex flex-col items-start gap-4 relative p-container'>
    <Badge>Il problema</Badge>

    <h2>Prodottizzare un servizio in Italia può essere difficile</h2>

    <div class='mt-9 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3'>
      {
        PROBLEM_CARDS.map(({ glow, number, icon: Icon, title, body }) => (
          <div
            class='flex flex-col gap-3 border-glass rounded-3xl bg-white/5 p-6 md:px-7.5 md:py-9'
            style={`--glow: ${glow}`}>
            <div class='flex gap-4 justify-between'>
              <b class='text-coral'>{number}</b>
              <Icon />
            </div>
            <h3 class='text-xl'>{title}</h3>
            <p class='text-sm text-white/55'>{body}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <p class='mt-11.5 text-2xl font-semibold'>
      Ciò che ti serve non è un altro corso comprato e non finito.{' '}
      <span class='bg-linear-to-br from-yellow to-coral bg-clip-text text-transparent'>
        Ma una comunity viva, reale, un metodo da seguire e diverse occasioni di lavoro, si.
      </span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .border-glass {
    transition:
      background-color 0.3s ease,
      box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .border-glass:hover {
    background-color: #0d0d0d;
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 -10px 18px -8px var(--glow),
      inset 0 -2px 3px var(--glow),
      inset 0 0 22px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55),
      0 14px 28px -14px var(--glow);
  }
</style>
